font-size:13px;&quot; color=&quot;#B03A2E&quot;&gt;reject / nack (requeue = false)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1215" y="586" width="300" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a49" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Exchange&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:15px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;wattwise.events.dlx&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;direct&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fdddb0;strokeColor=#E85D04;strokeWidth=2.5;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1068" y="650" width="255" height="165" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e50" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#B03A2E;strokeWidth=2.5;endSize=4;dashed=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1196" y="815" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1196" y="904" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="a51" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot; color=&quot;#B03A2E&quot;&gt;dead letters → inspect them in the UI :15672&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1215" y="848" width="340" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a52" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:15px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ms4.consumption-calculated.dlq&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="996" width="452" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a53" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Message (JSON)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="15" y="640" width="300" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a54" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;{&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;eventId&amp;quot;:&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;9c2e…&amp;quot;,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;ConsumptionCalculated&amp;quot;,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;occurredAt&amp;quot;:&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;2026-11-11T09:15Z&amp;quot;,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;payload&amp;quot;:&amp;nbsp;{&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;householdId&amp;quot;:&amp;nbsp;12,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;recordId&amp;quot;:&amp;nbsp;87,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;periodStart&amp;quot;:&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;2026-11-01&amp;quot;,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;periodEnd&amp;quot;:&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;2026-11-10&amp;quot;,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;quot;consumedKWh&amp;quot;:&amp;nbsp;84.2&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;" style="shape=note;size=16;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde0;strokeColor=#b5b045;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="12" y="672" width="350" height="262" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a55" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Design rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;• The &lt;b&gt;producer owns the exchange&lt;/b&gt;; &lt;b&gt;each consumer owns its queue&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;• MS2 publishes &lt;b&gt;after saving&lt;/b&gt; the record and never waits for the consumers.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;• MS4: manual ack, prefetch 10, &lt;b&gt;idempotent&lt;/b&gt; (remembers the eventIds already processed).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;• A rejected message goes to &lt;i&gt;wattwise.events.dlx → …dlq&lt;/i&gt; instead of being lost.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;• Delivery is &lt;b&gt;at least once&lt;/b&gt;: the same message can arrive twice.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;• If MS4 is stopped, messages wait in its queue: MS2 and MS5 are not affected.&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;size=16;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde0;strokeColor=#b5b045;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="12" y="1115" width="960" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a56" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Why MS4 uses an event (and not a REST call)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;• Challenge progress is a &lt;b&gt;reaction to a state change&lt;/b&gt; in MS2, not something a user waits for.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;• MS2 does not know MS4 exists: low coupling, no circuit breaker needed.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;• Progress = reduction vs the baseline (the first period received after joining).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Going further (proposals)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;• MS4 publishes &lt;i&gt;ChallengeCompleted&lt;/i&gt; (key &lt;i&gt;challenge.completed&lt;/i&gt;) → MS5 sends the notification.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px;&quot; color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;• Optional: ignore reductions caused only by reported power cuts (MS6 context).&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;size=16;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde0;strokeColor=#b5b045;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1030" y="1115" width="1050" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>